# What a Hub does

Global Shapers is the World Economic Forum's under-30 network, and the Riyadh Hub runs projects across the city. I joined in July 2026 as marketing lead. The projects were already good. Almost nobody outside the room knew about them.

---

# The job

Two halves. Coverage: getting every project the visibility it earned, working alongside the project leads instead of after them. Production: I lead the arm that makes things that aren't event recaps, which is where the filmmaker in me finally gets a budget line.

The Q4 plan is five content formats by December, one shared home for everything in Notion, and a marketing deck rebuilt from the ground up on the Hub's own template so it looks like it belongs to the Hub and not to me.

[abdullah: one anecdote from the first month]

> (yes, I know I just joined. ask me again in December.)
